On Thu, 31 May 2001, Arisman Adnan wrote:

> Dear S-ers,
>
> I have several Splus objects created under Splus version 3.4 Dec Alpha.
> Since the server is no longer work, then I can not access Splus
> anymore. But from sub-dir /.Data, I can get these files, and transfer
