There's a small bug in RC2 which causes S-PLUS to only show GUI help in the
Contents pane of the help window in some situations.  The workaround is to
simply choose "Language Reference" from the "Help" menu, which restores the
language help in the Contents/Index panes.

The function help files are all there, and ?lm will always work, for
example.

More details at the RC2 known bugs page:
http://www.insightful.com/products/preview/viewthread.asp?tid=232.

